WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Chad, marked in blue, reports spotting a sentinel.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Elena proposes Indeed Tower:
2 minutes and 42 seconds from her position.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Later, Chad estimates 15 minutes and 35 seconds
to Indeed Tower and suggests a store instead.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Later in the same run.
